#3001
The Testing Grounds~
   Welcome to the Testing Grounds, a small tutorial built to walk a new
character through the game one feature at a time. Nothing here can hurt
you badly, nothing here is required, and everything here can be tried
more than once - the whole zone resets itself regularly.
   To the north is the Hall of Movement, the first stop on the tour. Type
'north' (or just 'n') to head that way, and 'look' at any time to see a
room's description again.
~
