#3002
Hall of Movement~
   This plain hall exists to teach the words you will use every time you
play: 'north', 'south', 'east', 'west', 'up' and 'down' (or their short
forms 'n', 's', 'e', 'w', 'u', 'd') move you between rooms; 'look' (or
'l') shows you a room again; 'exits' lists which directions go anywhere
at all; 'score' shows your own condition.
   A corridor leads south back to the start, and continues north toward
the Door Room.
~
