#3003
The Door Room~
   A stout wooden door, closed for the moment, blocks the way north. This
is where 'open door' and 'close door' are worth learning - a shut door
stops you walking through it until you open it, the same as it would
stop anyone else. There is a rusty-looking key on the floor here; you
may want it before you go much further.
~
