#3004
The Locked Vault~
   Rather than a plain door, the one to the north is shut *and* locked.
'unlock door with key' (with the rusty key from the room before this one
in your inventory) undoes the lock, and 'open door' still has to be typed
separately afterward - locking and opening are two different states. A
thief could instead try 'pick door'.
~
