#3005
The Armory~
   Racked along the walls is a small armory's worth of gear: a plain
sword, a suit of leather, and a small brass lantern. 'get sword' (or
'get all') picks something up, 'wear tunic' or 'wield sword' puts it to
use, 'inventory' (or 'i') lists what you are carrying, and 'equipment'
(or 'eq') lists what you have on. 'remove sword' and 'drop sword' undo
both.
~
