#3006
The Cluttered Closet~
   A leather bag lies open on the floor beside a small wooden chest.
'put ring in bag' and 'get ring from bag' move things into and out of a
container you are carrying; the chest works the same way once you 'open
chest' first. 'examine bag' or 'examine chest' shows what is inside
either one, and so does 'look in bag' - but plain 'look chest' does not,
it only says whether there is anything special about the chest itself.
~
