#3008
The Sparring Ring~
   A straw-stuffed training dummy stands in the middle of the ring,
patiently waiting to be hit. 'kill dummy' starts a fight - it barely
fights back, so this is a safe place to see combat, a corpse, and
'get all corpse' happen for the first time. If you know any skills or
spells from a guild (the next room north teaches that), this is the
place to 'kick dummy', 'cast 'magic missile' dummy', or similar. A small
pile of loot sits against the wall: a scroll, a potion, a wand, a staff,
and some gold coins - 'recite scroll', 'quaff potion', and 'use wand' (or
'use staff') are worth trying on whatever is left of the dummy.
~
