#3009
The Resting Room~
   A few plain cots line the walls. 'rest' sits you down and recovers
hit points, mana and movement faster than standing around; 'sleep' does
the same faster still, but you cannot see or fight while asleep; 'wake'
and 'stand' bring you back up either way.
~
