#3010
Outside the Guildhall~
   A guildmaster waits here, ready to teach anyone who asks. 'practice'
on its own lists what you already know and what you could learn next;
'practice <name>' spends practice sessions to improve it. This
guildmaster teaches whatever your own class knows, not one fixed list -
try it and see what it offers you.
~
