#3011
The General Store~
   A shopkeeper stands behind a well-stocked counter. 'list' shows what
is for sale and for how much; 'buy dagger' (or 'buy cloak') pays for it;
'sell' offers something you are carrying back for a fraction of its
price; 'value sword' asks what the shopkeeper would give for an item
without actually selling it.
~
