#3012
The Bank of Testing~
   An automatic teller machine is bolted to the wall - there is no
teller here, just the machine itself, the same as the real game's own
bank counters. 'balance' shows what you have on deposit; 'deposit 50'
puts fifty coins in the bank, safe from anyone who might rob you;
'withdraw 50' takes them back out again.
~
