#3013
The Travelers' Rest~
   A receptionist offers a place to stay. 'rent' explains the price of a
room and, on this server, that there usually is not one - free_rent is
turned on here, the same way it is on the real game, so 'rent' mostly
just saves what you are carrying and lets you 'quit' without losing it.
Logging back in picks up exactly where you left off.
~
