#3014
The Post Office~
   A postmaster sorts letters behind the counter. 'mail Someone' starts
a letter to another character - there is no 'send' in it, and a stamp
costs 150 coins; 'check' asks whether anything has arrived; 'receive'
collects it once it has.
~
