#3016
Graduation Hall~
   That is the whole tour. A few things had no room of their own because
they need no room at all: 'smile', 'wave' and the rest of the socials
work anywhere, on anyone; 'say hello' and 'tell someone hello' talk to
whoever can hear you; 'group' and 'follow' need a second character to
try with. 'help' lists everything this tutorial did not cover.
   The way back is south, all the way to the Testing Grounds - nothing
here is one-way.
~
